                "description": "Ornate Lever with Rope Rose Fusion AE-B8 - The elegant design of this leverset is caused by the flow from the Rope Rose to the long, gentle curve of the Ornate Lever.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
